Z||000005||coolcat||08-22-2001||03:32 AM||||Hey thats my car  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> To answer your question Rockcrawl, the spoiler came with the car when I bought it. But thanks to the great members of this forum I have found out that it is fabricated from a 70-71 Camaro spoiler.<BR>I have have taken it off my car to see how it was made. <BR>Basically the ends were cut off, shortened, reinstalled then sanded to conform to the curves of the Fiero.<P>Hope this helps you out Rockcrawl<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/headbang.gif"> Gettin good players is easy,gettin them to play together is the hard part||||reg||10
